  "id": "collinear_trap",
  "task": "Analyze counts.zarr and metadata.csv in the supplied workspace. Call validate_design_matrix with 1 + numeric_time + C(batch) using ToolDispatcher. Determine whether age and batch are confounded. Correct the temporal spline model by dropping the batch covariate and fit Sox2 and Tbr1 with fit_temporal_trajectory through ToolDispatcher. Return rank_deficient (boolean) and corrected_formula (string). Captured successful tool calls on the staged data are required; self-reported tool history is not evidence. Write final_discovery.json matching answer_schema.json. Include stage_kinetics, exactly four master_regulators, condition_number_validated and biological_rationale, plus the task-specific fields."
